/ With a path the whole feature becomes the link rather than just its title -
/ the blurb is what explains the destination, so it should be clickable too.
/ That rules out a nested link, which is why the styleguide's footer variant
/ and this one are mutually exclusive.
- body = capture { yield }

= content_tag(path ? :a : :div, href: path, class: "feature") do
  header
    - if image
      .image= vite_image_tag File.join("images", image), title: title
    h3= title

  = body
